---
description: Keep the canon toolkit version out of commit subjects and pull request text
---

# Canon version standards

## Commits and pull requests

- Name what a canon sync or upgrade changed in frameboard, never the toolkit version it moved to, since `canon/config/config.json` already records the stamp.
- Leave the toolkit version out of a commit subject, a pull request title, a pull request body, and a review reply, in plain text and in a code span alike.
